# Local development secret names.
#
#     cp .secrets.example .secrets   # then fill in the value(s)
#
# .secrets is gitignored. NEVER commit it. This file lists names only.

# ── NEEDED LOCALLY ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NONE at present (2026-08-30). This block used to list GEMINI_API_KEY as
# "consumed by golden-scenarios.yml" — that became FALSE when the live
# Gemini eval was retired: golden-prose-daily.yml (which held the only
# `run_golden.py --live` invocation) and gemini-key-health.yml were both
# deleted, and golden-scenarios.yml now runs ONLY the offline
# schema-validate gate, which needs no secret at all. No local secrets are
# needed today and `.secrets` can be omitted entirely.

# ── CLOUD ONLY - do NOT put these in .secrets ───────────────────────
# Used only by schedule:-triggered workflows (alert-relay, offsite-backup,
# guard-config-audit, keyless-sa-audit, sql-dryrun-sweep, owner-actions-
# verify, wif-binding-audit). Those execute on GitHub and read their values
# from repository secrets there.
#   ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL
#   OFFSITE_BACKUP_GCS
